# Segmented inverse (S2): the precision budget and the Gaussian tail at the fitted parameters

`fit_PE`: `1000 · G ≤ 2^P` (`P = segPF p d s`) and `200 · segE ≤ 2^p`, given `D_{λ-1} ≤ 2^{⌊p/7⌋}`.
